{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0920_rocketchief_01",
      "hash": "9d82bf08a6225dfd",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波罗：到此为止了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0920_rival_01",
      "hash": "eea065068af47a9a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：哇，怎么又来了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0920_rocketchief_02",
      "hash": "9d82bc08a62258e4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波罗：无论几次我都会来的！\\c\\n因为我是不会让你们\\n到达我们老大那里的！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0920_rival_02",
      "hash": "eea064068af478e7",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：……咦？\\n他说“老大那里”？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0920_rival_03",
      "hash": "eea063068af47734",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，难道说！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0920_select_01",
      "hash": "a495754c28984226",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "他就在前面！"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0920_select_02",
      "hash": "a495744c28984073",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "坂木就在这里！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0920_rival_04",
      "hash": "eea062068af47581",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：原来火箭队的\\n老大在这幢楼里……！\\c\\n很好，既然这样！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0920_rival_05",
      "hash": "eea061068af473ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n去吧！这是打倒火箭队老大的大好机会！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0920_rival_06",
      "hash": "eea060068af4721b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "大叔！我才是你的对手！"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0920_rocketchief_03",
      "hash": "9d82bd08a6225a97",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "阿波罗：可恶！\\n既然这样，我得赶紧联系老大……"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0920_rival_07",
      "hash": "eea05f068af47068",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]：[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n去吧！一定要打倒火箭队的老大啊！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_rival_01_p01_cave_d1007",
